### Check if possible to start a new battle
GET http://localhost:8080/api/campaign/1/battle/check-availability
Authorization: Bearer {{BEARER_TOKEN}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

### Start a new battle
POST http://localhost:8080/api/campaign/1/battle/new
Authorization: Bearer {{BEARER_TOKEN}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json